<view class="page"><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{image.id}}"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">原始账单</text><text class="badge">{{image.statusText}}</text></view><image class="receipt" src="{{base}}/images/{{image.id}}/file" mode="widthFix" bindtap="preview"/><text class="muted">点击图片放大 · 归档日期 {{image.business_date}}</text><view class="error" wx:if="{{image.error_message}}">{{image.error_message}}</view><view class="row"><button class="small secondary" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{busy}}">刷新</button><button class="small secondary" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy || image.status === 'processing' || image.status === 'queued'}}">重新识别</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{bill}}"><view class="notice">{{bill.reviewText}} · {{bill.duplicateText}}。金额按元填写，时间格式为 YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss。点击“确认空值”可明确保留无法辨认的字段为空。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{issues.length}}"><view wx:for="{{issues}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{duplicates.length}}"><text class="section-title">疑似重复账单</text><text class="muted">若当前照片与以下记录是同一张票据，选择保留的原始账单；若编号识别错误，请修改编号。</text><view wx:for="{{duplicates}}" wx:key="id"><view class="line">{{item.bill_no}} · {{item.room_name}} · ¥{{item.money}}</view><button class="secondary small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="duplicate" disabled="{{busy}}">保留此记录，当前照片确认为重复</button></view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{bill.canonical_bill_id}}"><text class="section-title">已确认重复</text><text class="muted">当前照片与原始账单关联，仅保留追溯，不计入营业额。</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="canonical">查看保留的原始账单</button><button class="danger" bindtap="undoDuplicate" disabled="{{busy}}">撤销重复确认</button></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">字段核对</text><view class="field" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key"><text class="field-label">{{item.label}} {{item.unit ? '（元）' : ''}}</text><input value="{{item.value}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="未识别 / 空值"/><view class="field-note">自动值：{{item.detected}} · 置信度 {{item.confidence}} · {{item.state}}</view><button class="small secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="clear" disabled="{{busy}}">确认空值</button></view><button bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !dirty}}">保存字段修正</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="review" disabled="{{busy || dirty || bill.duplicate_status !== 'none'}}">确认人工复核</button></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">修改历史</text><view class="line" wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="id"><text>{{item.label}}：{{item.oldText}} → {{item.newText}}</text><view class="muted">{{item.edited_at}} · {{item.reason}}</view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!logs.length}}">暂无人工修改。</view></view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{runs.length}}"><text class="section-title">OCR 识别历史</text><view class="line" wx:for="{{runs}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.statusText}} · {{item.engine}} {{item.engine_version}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.started_at}} → {{item.completed_at}}</view><text class="mono" selectable>{{item.raw_text || item.error_message}}</text></view></view></view>
